Applications &amp; Demos
========================

Portable downloads for Windows. Prefer the **ZIP** (jpackage app-image with bundled runtime): unzip, then double-click `AppName.exe`.

Application binaries are **not** stored in the JRebirth git repository. Maven site pages link to **[${appsDownloadBase}](${appsDownloadBase})** (DMZ static host, same idea as `downloads.ezdojo.net` for EZDojo). Publish ZIPs with Hosting `publish-jrebirth-to-dmz.ps1` after `tools/stage-jrebirth-apps.ps1`.

Conference slide decks live on the [Presentations](../presentations/index.html) page.

